<title>GERMANY: German cabinet meeting ends - govt sources.</title>
<headline>German cabinet meeting ends - govt sources.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German cabinet has concluded its meeting, which was expected to include a discussion of foreign exchange developments, government sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The sources would give no details about the discussion and it was not clear whether there would be any statement ahead of a regular government news conference at 1230 GMT.</p>
<p>Earlier government sources said a government spokesman would probably make a statement on foreign exchange developments at the regular news conference.</p>
<p>-- william.boston@reuters.com (Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097 150)</p>
